  "Behind the Spot: Visit French Lick": "Behind the Session: Meet Day",
  "The Basement": "Masters 40+",
  "&quot;We brought PARAGON in as our production partner to help bring our campaign to life. They had the kind of enthusiasm you want in a director &amp; production company. They were genuinely excited about our campaign vision and helped us plus it up in the right ways. Their team found clever ways to keep a tough shoot running smoothly, balancing natural light and a packed schedule, and they stayed true to the tone and pacing we set out to capture. The spots turned out great, and honestly, I just liked working with these dudes.&quot;": "&quot;I walked into STEADFAST at 46 with a bad back and zero confidence under a barbell. The coaches had the kind of patience you want when you're starting over. They were genuinely excited about my goals and helped me build them up the right way. They found smart ways to work around my old injuries, balancing hard sessions with a packed work schedule, and they never once let me skip the warm-up. A year later I'm pain-free and deadlifting twice my bodyweight, and honestly, I just like training with these people.&quot;",
  "&quot;The PARAGON team was great to partner with on our recent brand campaign. They took a difficult brief and limited budget, then delivered on it with excellence. Add to that they were both professional and fun to work with!&quot;": "&quot;The STEADFAST coaches were great to start with after years away from the gym. They took my crowded calendar and a stubborn knee, then built a plan that actually worked. Add to that they're both serious and fun to train with!&quot;",
  "Luke Oppliger": "Luke Ortega",
  "Head of Creative &amp; Content, T. Marzetti Company": "Member since 2024, Strength Foundations Program",
  "&quot;PARAGON has a rare creative vision that goes beyond just telling a story. They bring it to life in ways that feel unforgettable. They created a film that captured the emotion, nuance and power of the sport with a level of care and authenticity that&#x27;s hard to find. More than just professionals, they became friends who genuinely cared about making this project special, and in turn left me with memories I will treasure forever.&quot;": "&quot;STEADFAST has a rare way of coaching that goes beyond just writing a program. They make every session feel like it counts. They built a plan around my sport, my schedule and my goals with a level of care and attention that&#x27;s hard to find. More than just coaches, they became people who genuinely cared about getting me to the next level, and in turn gave me a season I will remember forever. They pushed me hard and never once let me coast.&quot;",
  "Vaughn Beesley": "Jalen Price",
