  "Client: Visit French Lick": "For: Lifters 30+",
  "A campaign for Visit French Lick that used slow pacing and dry humor to reflect the timeless character of the destination.": "A mobility and recovery program that uses slow tempo and breathing to undo the damage of long days at a desk.",
  "A cinematic anthem that spotlighted resilience and humanity in the fight against cancer.": "A yearly charity lift where members raise money and miles for families in the fight against cancer.",
  "Client: New York Bakery": "For: Intermediate Lifters",
  "A playful, POV-driven campaign for New York Bakery that follows families through the chaos of the dinnertime rush and shows how Texas Toast brings calm back to the table.": "A barbell program for lifters who know the basics and want real numbers: squat, bench, deadlift and press, coached rep by rep, with a meet day at the end.",
  "Client: Aunt Millie’s Bakery": "For: Beginners",
  "A playful campaign for Aunt Millie’s that puts the brand’s bright red apron everywhere, from yoga class to the construction site to the baseball field.": "A six-week starter program that teaches the basic lifts from zero, for anyone who has never touched a barbell or is starting over.",
  "Client: First Bank": "For: Small Groups",
